{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古嗣靈源清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不列章次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秀嗣死心新，新嗣晦堂心。"}
