{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此後無傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一嗣泐潭清，清嗣晦堂心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不列章次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "震嗣泐潭清"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此後無傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖嗣青原信，信嗣晦堂心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遊嗣泐潭準，準嗣寶峯文，文嗣黃龍南。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不列章次"}
